<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Are thy tired feet unsteady?</l><l>Does thy lamp no light afford?</l><l>Is thy cross too great and heavy?</l><l>“Cast thy burden on the Lord.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Are the ties of friendship severed?</l><l>Hushed the voices fondly heard?</l><l>Breaks thy heart with weight of anguish?</l><l>“Cast thy burden on the Lord.”</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Does thy heart with faintness falter?</l><l>Does thy mind forget His word?</l><l>Does thy strength succumb to weakness?</l><l>“Cast thy burden on the Lord.”</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>He will hold thee up from falling;</l><l>He will guide thy steps aright;</l><l>He will strengthen each endeavor;</l><l>He will keep thee by His might.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
